* PedalKernel LED Models — SPICE .MODEL format
*
* LED forward voltage is primarily determined by the emission coefficient (N).
* Higher N = higher Vf. The IS values are similar across types.
*
* LED_IR:     Infrared GaAs (Vf≈1.2V)
* LED_RED:    Red GaAs (Vf≈1.7V)
* LED_GREEN:  Red/Green/Yellow/Amber GaAs (Vf≈2.1V)
* LED_BLUE:   Blue SiC (Vf≈3.4V)

* Infrared GaAs, Vf≈1.2V
.MODEL DLED0 D(IS=93.5P RS=84M N=2.63 BV=5 IBV=10U CJO=2.97P VJ=.75 M=.333 TT=4.32U)
* Red GaAs, Vf≈1.7V
.MODEL DLED1 D(IS=93.2P RS=42M N=3.73 BV=4 IBV=10U CJO=2.97P VJ=.75 M=.333 TT=4.32U)
* Red/Green/Yellow/Amber GaAs, Vf≈2.1V
.MODEL DLED2 D(IS=93.1P RS=42M N=4.61 BV=4 IBV=10U CJO=2.97P VJ=.75 M=.333 TT=4.32U)
* Blue SiC, Vf≈3.4V
.MODEL DLED3 D(IS=93.1P RS=42M N=7.47 BV=5 IBV=30U CJO=2.97P VJ=.75 M=.333 TT=4.32U)

* ── Friendly Aliases ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

.MODEL LED_IR D(IS=93.5P RS=84M N=2.63 BV=5 IBV=10U CJO=2.97P VJ=.75 M=.333 TT=4.32U)
.MODEL LED_RED D(IS=93.2P RS=42M N=3.73 BV=4 IBV=10U CJO=2.97P VJ=.75 M=.333 TT=4.32U)
.MODEL LED_GREEN D(IS=93.1P RS=42M N=4.61 BV=4 IBV=10U CJO=2.97P VJ=.75 M=.333 TT=4.32U)
.MODEL LED_BLUE D(IS=93.1P RS=42M N=7.47 BV=5 IBV=30U CJO=2.97P VJ=.75 M=.333 TT=4.32U)
.MODEL LED_YELLOW D(IS=93.1P RS=42M N=4.61 BV=4 IBV=10U CJO=2.97P VJ=.75 M=.333 TT=4.32U)
.MODEL LED_AMBER D(IS=93.1P RS=42M N=4.61 BV=4 IBV=10U CJO=2.97P VJ=.75 M=.333 TT=4.32U)
